p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and April to May came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October came in at 27% of normal and October to November at 22% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 21% of normal there. Every grid had its driest year in 1954.</p>"}
